[I] TUI for managing bluetooth on Linux

[T] bluetui is a terminal user interface written in Rust for managing
[T] Bluetooth devices on Linux via BlueZ. It allows scanning for, pairing,
[T] connecting and trusting devices from the console.

[U] https://github.com/pythops/bluetui

[A] pythops
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/tool
